	(text_box "Power:\n\nLoad	Maximum\n4 x LMH0344 - 400 mA\n4 x GS2988 internal consumption - 256 mA\nGS2988 external 75 Ω output terminations - 45.8 mA\nX1 oscillator - 28 mA datasheet maximum\nSTM32G031, 64 MHz plus peripherals - 8.9 mA\nPCAL6416 core consumption - 0.15 mA\nAll LEDs, using resistor-only upper bounds - 29.9 mA\nR_GA and VIO-good pull resistors - 1.0 mA\nOther control pull resistors - approximately 4 mA\n\nCalculated maximum is approximately 774 mA\nLikely closer to ~850mA"
